WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.470 --> 00:00:06.224
Hardworking, motivated, team player. I hear those words ten times a day.

2
00:00:06.264 --> 00:00:08.918
Without proof, they mean nothing.

3
00:00:08.958 --> 00:00:13.039
Tell me a real situation, what you did, and the result.

4
00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:15.526
With a number, if you can.
